1
00:00:00,125 --> 00:00:01,001
You're lying.

2
00:00:03,586 --> 00:00:04,713
I told you.

3
00:00:05,171 --> 00:00:06,506
My son doesn't lie.

4
00:00:06,881 --> 00:00:07,841
Oh my God.

5
00:00:09,175 --> 00:00:11,302
No wonder
she looked familiar.

6
00:00:12,053 --> 00:00:14,556
You truly are
the Knights' owner.

7
00:00:16,099 --> 00:00:18,768
Oh my God.
What have I done?

8
00:00:20,103 --> 00:00:21,146
You have
a lot of nerve.

9
00:00:21,813 --> 00:00:22,605
First you destroy

10
00:00:22,605 --> 00:00:24,524
a three-million-dollar
painting of mine,

11
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:26,609
and then you
try hitting on me?

12
00:00:27,485 --> 00:00:28,486
Tell me, Allen,

13
00:00:28,862 --> 00:00:30,280
how do you plan
on paying for this?

14
00:00:30,363 --> 00:00:31,948
What? Pay for that?

15
00:00:32,282 --> 00:00:33,575
Three million?

16
00:00:33,575 --> 00:00:34,784
Even if I sold myself,

17
00:00:34,784 --> 00:00:36,453
I could never
pay that off.

18
00:00:36,453 --> 00:00:37,495
Oh no.

19
00:00:37,495 --> 00:00:38,955
No, no...

20
00:00:38,955 --> 00:00:40,373
It's all
a misunderstanding.

21
00:00:40,582 --> 00:00:42,208
I mean, he was
just being impulsive.

22
00:00:42,417 --> 00:00:43,209
Please, please, please,

23
00:00:43,209 --> 00:00:44,294
have mercy on us.

24
00:00:44,294 --> 00:00:45,670
Absolutely.

25
00:00:45,670 --> 00:00:46,880
A misunderstanding,

26
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:47,672
huh?

27
00:00:47,839 --> 00:00:49,716
Was it
a misunderstanding

28
00:00:49,716 --> 00:00:51,134
when you
insulted us earlier?

29
00:00:51,551 --> 00:00:52,343
Ted.

30
00:00:52,552 --> 00:00:54,554
Allen absolutely
knows he's wrong.

31
00:00:54,554 --> 00:00:55,013
Yes.

32
00:00:55,180 --> 00:00:56,765
We're very,
very sorry.

33
00:00:56,765 --> 00:00:58,016
Can you let
this go, please?

34
00:00:58,016 --> 00:00:58,683
Please.

35
00:00:59,726 --> 00:01:01,019
Obviously,

36
00:01:01,269 --> 00:01:03,730
you have
loads of money.

37
00:01:03,730 --> 00:01:04,314
I mean,

38
00:01:04,314 --> 00:01:05,940
you're not gonna
miss a few million.

39
00:01:06,316 --> 00:01:08,985
But this would
ruin my family.

40
00:01:10,153 --> 00:01:11,237
You want me
to forgive him?

41
00:01:12,113 --> 00:01:12,864
Please.

42
00:01:14,032 --> 00:01:14,783
If I were the one

43
00:01:14,783 --> 00:01:15,950
who damaged
the property,

44
00:01:15,950 --> 00:01:17,869
would you be so
quick to forgive me?

45
00:01:19,996 --> 00:01:20,663
Listen,

46
00:01:22,248 --> 00:01:23,583
you can mock me
all you'd like,

47
00:01:25,168 --> 00:01:26,377
but don't ever

48
00:01:26,586 --> 00:01:27,837
insult my father.
